   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2.1. Increased capacity of Member States to ratify international labour standards</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">P029 - Protocol of 2014 to the Forced Labour Convention, 1930 ratified on 21 Mar 2022 (in force). With support from the Government of the United States, ILO provided technical support and advice to Malaysian government, including sessions on awareness and knowledge of the Protocol in both Peninsular Malaysia and East Malaysia (Sabah and Sarawak), data collection and the production of a Gap Analysis of Malaysian Legal Framework and ILO Forced Labour Convention and Protocol &#x2013; in collaboration with the Ministry of Human Resources (MOHR), Malaysian Employers Federation (MEF), Malaysian Trades Unions Congress (MTUC), the Human Rights Commission and the Malaysian Bar Council &#x2013; in September 2018.</narrative>
   </description>
